PIERRE COMPUTER COMPANY █ PROJECT: ICONS

```

CONTACT: SUPPORT@PIERRE.CO
LOCATION: USA
STATUS: ONLINE
OPEN POSITIONS: [Systems Engineer](https://pierre.computer/careers/systems-engineer)

```

OVERVIEW:

- Built for [Diffs.com](https://diffs.com),
  [Trees.software](https://trees.software), and
  [DiffsHub.com](https://diffshub.com).
- Available as source SVGs exported from Figma and as compiled React components.

INSTALL:

```bash
npm install @pierre/icons@beta
```

USAGE:

The stable and v2 beta collections can be imported together during the beta:

```tsx
import { IconCheck as StableIconCheck } from '@pierre/icons';
import { IconCheck as BetaIconCheck } from '@pierre/icons/beta';
```
